  "description": "When Yi-hwan woke up, the world had changed. Zombies craving the blood of the living, Humans running for their lives. But then...\n\n*\"Why aren't the zombies biting me?\"*\n\nUnbelievable strength, One eye turned red, just like the zombies, And a strange hunger every time he sees blood.\n\n*\"What the hell happened to me?!\"*\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
